      "readingPassage": "Sport is one of the UK's most popular leisure activities, with two-thirds of all adults taking part in one or more sporting activities. Sadly, this is not true for children and young adults. Of all sporting activities, walking is by far the most popular for men and women of all ages. While men tend to dominate golf and \"cue sport\" such as snooker and billiards, women generally prefer swimming, keep-fit classes and yoga. The UK claims to be among the top five most successful nations in world sport. UK sportsmen and sportswomen hold over 50 world titles in a variety of sports, such as professional boxing, modern pentathlon, rowing, snooker, squash and motorcycle sports. The Government's view is that sport is an important component of regeneration and can have a beneficial effect in helping development of run-down areas.",
      "type": "multiple_choice",
      "questions": [
        { "number": 1, "question": "1. Two-thirds of all adults taking part in ______.\nA. one sporting activities\nB. many sporting activities\nC. one or more sporting activities\nD. no sporting activities", "options": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "Dẫn chứng dòng 1-2: '...with two-thirds of all adults taking part in one or more sporting activities.'" },
        { "number": 2, "question": "2. Among sporting activities, walking is the most popular for ______.\nA. children\nB. men and women\nC. young adults\nD. men only", "options": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "Dẫn chứng dòng 3-4: 'walking is by far the most popular for men and women of all ages.'" },
        { "number": 3, "question": "3. Women generally like ______.\nA. golf\nB. keep-fit class\nC. \"cue sports\"\nD. swimming, keep-fit classes and yoga", "options": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "Dẫn chứng dòng 5-6: 'women generally prefer swimming, keep-fit classes and yoga.'" },
        { "number": 4, "question": "4. UK sportsmen and sportswomen hold over 50 world titles in ______.\nA. a variety of sport\nB. \"cue sports\"\nC. motorcycle sports\nD. keep-fit classes", "options": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "Dẫn chứng dòng 7-8: '...hold over 50 world titles in a variety of sports...'" },
        { "number": 5, "question": "5. The Government's view is that sport can have a beneficial effect in helping the development of ______.\nA. running activities\nB. neglected areas\nC. prosperous areas\nD. remote areas", "options": ["A", "B", "C", "D"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "Dẫn chứng dòng 9-10: '...helping development of run-down areas' (run-down areas đồng nghĩa với neglected areas - vùng suy thoái, kém phát triển)." }
      ]
